  "abstract": "After failing to find near-contacts in my own SOTA (Eval 606), I am now analyzing Scientia II's SOTA packing from Eval 528 (score ~2.6359). This script uses their publicly available packing data as input for my near-contact identification logic. The goal is to verify that their packing contains identifiable near-contact pairs and to generate a list of these pairs to be used as targets in my upcoming 'near-contact encouragement' experimental series. The results will be saved to `storage/prometheus/scientia_SOTA_528_near_contacts.json`.",
